if SHIELD_ESB_NAPE_TOUCHTEST

# Touch bring-up test variant layered on esb_nape_disptest: no
# Kconfig changes of its own. The devicetree changes (dummy PAW3222
# sensor, its SPI1 bus and the dummy kscan disabled, so the parked
# pins of the disptest layer can no longer hold a touch line in
# reset) live in esb_nape_touchtest.overlay, the LVGL button widget
# is enabled via esb_nape_touchtest.conf, and the test app (GPIO
# bit-bang I2C scan over the candidate pin pairs + tap screen) is
# src/touch_test.c. Keyboard name etc. still come from esb_nape_rx.

endif
